# Copy to `.env.local` for local overrides. Not needed for local dev by default —
# Vite/nginx proxy /api and /hubs to the backend on the same origin (see nginx.conf,
# docker-compose.yml, vite.config.ts).
#
# Set this when frontend and backend are deployed to different hosts
# (e.g. frontend on Vercel, backend on Render): the backend's public origin, no trailing slash.
# Example: VITE_API_URL=https://aihelpdesk-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=
